<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mail-Well started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mail-Well started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it initiated coverage of Mail-Well Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
<p>-- Mail-Well gained one to 19-7/8.</p>
</text>
